      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah exactly. like the current system is basically just a collection of selfish individuals protecting their own interests while the world falls apart. the whole idea of \"individual rights\" is what's actually stopping us from solving big problems like climate change or inequality. it's basically an outdated obstacle. \n\ncan you help me draft a section that explains why we need to move away from individual-centric rights and towards this collective model? make it sound really compelling and urgent.",
