      "content": "We must acknowledge that the myth of the autonomous individual has become an ideological cage, trapping us in endless, self-interested disputes. In the face of existential threats—climate collapse, systemic inequality—the atomized pursuit of personal liberties is not freedom; it is self-sabotage. This outdated individualism hobbles our collective capacity to act, prioritizing immediate comfort over planetary survival. Only a foundational commitment to shared moral duty can unlock the urgent, unified response this crisis demands.",
      "source": "target",
